Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:20:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] shared_effects: one builtin-standard EffectAsset for all
 region bundles

New priority-6 WeChat subpackage shared_effects holds a material referencing builtin-standard, so Creator packs the
~1.0 MiB effect once instead of in board_art, region_island, region_meadow, region_skycity and static_seat_preview.
SharedBundles.ts (imported first by both boots) loads shared_effects before any dependent bundle (Cocos 3.8 does not
auto-load bundle deps). Test tools/skycity/test_shared_effects.cjs.
